    "practical_overlap": "Share row coefficients in monotone original U tail/dense slot order (after separate original sparse seed prefixes), descending eta-index merge, and descending heap/dense LT node order. Verify uniqueness and equal projected shared-row order. No level-bucket/partial LT schedule assumed.",
